{"schema_version":"d_pc_direction_full_review_cover_patch_round2_v1","steam_appid":"4714810","display_title":"再战大极品+255","sources":{"player":{"label":"普通玩家","readable_count":23,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"p001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"免费 有中文 没成就","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/heiyao/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p002","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"还没怎么玩呢都有1万多的攻击了 怎么玩","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199850013615/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p003","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"换汤不换药，不充钱，连捐赠都不行，各种礼包，没找到哪里送真充卡的，也许有，但藏得太深，我没看到，能不能坦诚点呢","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198048243092/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p004","recommendation":"推荐","text":"签到给的真充卡攒着用，今天凑了30块充进去，零氪也能体验充值的感觉","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776669757/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p005","recommendation":"推荐","text":"在线时长领元宝很实在，挂一晚上起来领一大笔，日常消耗足够了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775953805/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p006","recommendation":"推荐","text":"+255装备回收换灵符很划算，爆到属性一般的极品也能卖不少资源","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198778827453/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p007","recommendation":"推荐","text":"三职业平衡做得不错，战士和道士组队打BOSS配合好，效率比单刷高多了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776890552/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p008","recommendation":"推荐","text":"BOSS刷新点分布广，不会被大行会全包，散人等刷新也能抢到","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198773848035/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p009","recommendation":"推荐","text":"专属装备爆率可以，打了几天出了两件，穿上之后战力直接涨了一截","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198778119542/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p010","recommendation":"推荐","text":"上手简单，跟着主线走就能摸清楚玩法，不用看长篇攻略慢慢研究","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198777562480/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p011","recommendation":"推荐","text":"交易行元宝流通快，打到不用的装备挂上去基本当天就卖出去了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775390578/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p012","recommendation":"推荐","text":"野外PK有红名惩罚，乱杀人会被守卫打，普通玩家环境还算安全","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199889639164/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p013","recommendation":"推荐","text":"装备强化有保底机制，不会连续失败，资源花着放心","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774647620/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p014","recommendation":"推荐","text":"合区节奏控制得好，不会突然合并导致资源点爆满，过渡比较平稳","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198775984261/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p015","recommendation":"推荐","text":"小怪也能出大极品，打野怪一直有期待感，不会觉得白打","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774341886/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p016","recommendation":"推荐","text":"经验获取速度适中，不会慢得让人着急，也不会升得太快没目标","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774713364/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p017","recommendation":"推荐","text":"活动时间安排得合理，白天晚上都有，不同时间在线的玩家都能参与","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776545555/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p018","recommendation":"推荐","text":"游戏环境挺干净，很少看到外挂广告刷屏，官方有在管","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198778131430/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p019","recommendation":"推荐","text":"每日在线奖励档位合理，挂一个小时能领完所有档位，不用挂太久","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774052243/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p020","recommendation":"推荐","text":"装备回收系统给的强化石够用，淘汰的装备能换材料继续用","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776660969/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p021","recommendation":"推荐","text":"灵气系统提供额外的成长线，签到和打怪都能攒，长期有目标追","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776749637/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p022","recommendation":"推荐","text":"大极品鉴定出高数值的时候特别爽，一件装备能让战力翻一截","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198776294391/recommended/4714810/"},{"id":"p023","recommendation":"推荐","text":"第一天玩下来感觉可以，明天继续上线签到领转生石，慢慢养成","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198774770055/recommended/4714810/"}],"groups":[{"key":"funny","label":"欢乐","review_ids":["p001"]},{"key":"summary","label":"概要","review_ids":["p002","p003","p010","p012","p014","p015","p016","p017","p018","p021","p022","